    <string name="settings_opening_a_pdf">Opening a PDF</string>
    <string name="settings_opening_a_pdf_as_text">New PDFs are re-set by this app - its type at the size you asked for, and translations in the paragraph rather than over the page. A scan with no text in it opens as its own pages anyway.</string>
    <string name="settings_opening_a_pdf_as_pages">New PDFs open as the file's maker laid them out. Any of them can still be read as text from the reader's own panel.</string>

    <!-- What is translated, and when. -->
    <string name="settings_translate_into_footnote">Tap a sentence while reading to translate it, and tap it again for the original.</string>
    <string name="settings_pointing_at_the_book">Pointing at the book</string>
    <string name="settings_pointing_footnote">Each does one thing, always. Doing it again on the same passage puts the book\u2019s own words back - except on a word you have looked up, where holding opens more about it instead.</string>
    <string name="settings_tap_to_translate">Tap a word to translate it</string>
    <string name="settings_asking_for_more">Asking for more than a word</string>
    <string name="settings_asking_for_more_footnote">A dictionary answers a word and nothing larger, so these do nothing until a translation service is set up above. Off here is the same off as the switches under Translating.</string>
    <string name="settings_hold_again">Hold a word again for more about it</string>
    <string name="settings_translating_ahead">Translating ahead</string>
    <string name="settings_translating_ahead_footnote">Both are new, and both are slow and expensive: they translate a screenful at a time rather than the passage you pointed at. Off until you ask for them, and hidden from the reader entirely while they are.</string>
    <string name="settings_on_screen_detail">Adds a button that translates every sentence you can see, once.</string>
    <string name="settings_as_you_read_detail">Adds a button that goes on translating whatever scrolls into view until you turn it off. This is the expensive one.</string>

    <!-- Who answers. -->
    <string name="settings_translation_service">Translation service</string>
    <string name="settings_translation_service_footnote">Nothing under this page does anything until this is set up. Looking a word up under Translating works without it; a whole sentence does not — it goes to a model you pay for by the passage.</string>
